<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Global Refund Services</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#29233a;background:#faf8ff}
header{background:#fff;padding:18px 6%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.logo{font-size:21px;font-weight:bold;color:#6636b5}
nav a{margin:8px;color:#403653;text-decoration:none}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(130deg,#54259c,#8c54d6);color:white;padding:75px 7%;text-align:center}
.hero h1{font-size:38px;margin:0 0 15px}
.hero p{max-width:650px;margin:auto;line-height:1.7}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:white;color:#6636b5;padding:13px 24px;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;margin-top:22px}
section{padding:48px 7%;text-align:center}
h2{color:#6334a9}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:18px;margin-top:25px}
.card{background:white;padding:25px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 3px 15px #24104412}
.card h3{color:#6737b1}
form{max-width:600px;margin:25px auto;text-align:left;background:white;padding:25px;border-radius:12px}
label{display:block;margin:14px 0 6px;font-weight:bold}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:6px;font-size:15px}
button{background:#6938b5;color:white;border:0;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:7px;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer;margin-top:18px}
.notice{background:#f0e8ff;padding:15px;border-radius:8px;line-height:1.6}
footer{background:#24143b;color:white;text-align:center;padding:30px}
footer a{color:white}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<div class="logo">GLOBAL REFUND SERVICES</div>
<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#services">Services</a>
<a href="#request">Request Help</a>
<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>
</header>

<div class="hero" id="home">
<h1>Refund Assistance Made Simple</h1>
<p>Get guidance with refund enquiries, purchase disputes and delivery-related refund concerns. We help you understand the next steps.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#request">Submit an Enquiry</a>
</div>

<section id="services">
<h2>How We Can Help</h2>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card"><h3>Purchase Refund Guidance</h3><p>Understand the steps involved in requesting a refund for an online purchase.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Delivery Issues</h3><p>Get guidance when an order has been delayed, cancelled or not delivered.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Payment Disputes</h3><p>Learn how to contact your payment provider about a disputed transaction.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Case Assistance</h3><p>Organise your enquiry details and understand possible next steps.</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="request">
<h2>Refund Assistance Enquiry</h2>
<p>Complete the form below to prepare your enquiry.</p>
<div class="notice">This website is an independent assistance service. We are not a bank, government agency or payment processor. We cannot guarantee refunds.</div>
<form id="refundForm">
<label>Your name</label>
<input required name="name" placeholder="Enter your name">
<label>Email address</label>
<input required type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your email">
<label>Order reference (optional)</label>
<input name="order" placeholder="Enter order reference">
<label>Type of enquiry</label>
<select name="type">
<option>Online purchase</option>
<option>Delivery issue</option>
<option>Payment dispute</option>
<option>Other</option>
</select>
<label>Explain your enquiry</label>
<textarea required name="details" rows="5" placeholder="Describe what happened"></textarea>
<p class="notice">Do not enter passwords, bank PINs, card numbers or verification codes.</p>
<button type="submit">Prepare Enquiry</button>
<p id="message"></p>
</form>
</section>

<section id="contact">
<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<p>Email: <a href="mailto:tendoamber@gmail.com">tendoamber@gmail.com</a></p>
<p>Use our website chat for general enquiries.</p>
</section>

<footer>
<p><strong>Global Refund Services</strong></p>
<p>Independent refund assistance and customer guidance.</p>
<p><a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a> | <a href="terms.html">Terms of Service</a></p>
<p>© 2026 Global Refund Services</p>
</footer>

<script>
document.getElementById("refundForm").addEventListener("submit",function(e){
e.preventDefault();
document.getElementById("message").textContent =
"Your enquiry form is ready. This demonstration website does not yet send or store enquiries. Please contact us by email.";
});
</script>

